+# Name: 渐变宽度+停在中间
+#
+# Design analysis
+# ---------------
+# a) Concrete form + behavior trace:
+#    - Visuals stay close to the base task: green background, one connected blue river,
+#      one black n×n mover, one red n×n destination of the same size.
